; Test: Strict rules
; Coverage: strict implication, chained strict, multi-premise strict
; Strict rules produce +D (definitely provable) conclusions

; Simple strict rule
(given human)
(always s1 human mortal)

; Chained strict rules
(given water)
(always s2 water liquid)
(always s3 liquid flows)

; Multi-premise strict rule
(given hot)
(given dry)
(always s4 (and hot dry) fire-risk)

; EXPECT: +D human
; EXPECT: +D mortal
; EXPECT: +D water
; EXPECT: +D liquid
; EXPECT: +D flows
; EXPECT: +D hot
; EXPECT: +D dry
; EXPECT: +D fire-risk
; EXPECT: +d mortal
; EXPECT: +d liquid
; EXPECT: +d flows
; EXPECT: +d fire-risk
